    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Named for the quarian Reegar family, who have served as marines for generations, this carbine is less a shotgun than a short-range lightning projector. It discharges a continuous electrical arc that overloads shields and cooks anything standing behind them. Its reach is very short, and inside that reach little survives it.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
